                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset includes qualitative information from focus group discussions with farm-level, agri-businesses and consumer experts on crop improvement strategies for future-proofing.<br>Data were collected in a series of online workshops based on a semi-structured protocol that facilitated the appraisal of Cropbooster-P options and impact assessment and was supported by whiteboard software.</p>"
